Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.58,0:01:47.28,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,It would appear that our \Ntargets have entered the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.28,0:01:48.23,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,There are three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.87,0:01:50.96,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,The two in the back probably \Nhave bigger builds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.16,0:01:55.05,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,They are avoiding standing \Nnext to any windows or doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.05,0:01:57.28,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Judging by their footsteps, \Nthey're definitely pros.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.48,0:02:06.06,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Conrad has sat down on \Nthe sofa next to the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.06,0:02:08.91,main,Conrad,0,0,0,,All right, let's have you \Nhand over the goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.91,0:02:11.04,main,Conrad,0,0,0,,You'll get your payment after.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.43,0:02:14.37,main,A,0,0,0,,I-I'm gonna hold you to your word.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.81,0:02:21.10,italics,Conrad,0,0,0,,This is definitely MNG data. \NAll right, as promised...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.10,0:02:22.49,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I've confirmed the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.49,0:02:24.36,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,All right. Let's head in...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.76,0:02:25.54,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.03,0:02:27.20,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:39.27,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,We're with the State Security Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.31,0:02:43.00,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,You're all under arrest on \Nsuspicion of being spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.56,0:02:48.54,main,Conrad,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.18,0:02:51.06,main,Conrad,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:56.69,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Good evening, Mister Vile Trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.95,0:02:59.68,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,We have a wonderful cell \Nreserved just for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:01.58,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,so please accompany us \Nto the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.61,0:03:07.70,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(320,145)\fscx50\fad(1030,1)}Mission and Family
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:10.69,main,Boss,0,0,0,,Well done, Second Lieutenant Briar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.07,0:03:12.51,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:15.75,main,Boss,0,0,0,,We need you to take care \Nof this fellow next.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.75,0:03:19.34,main,Boss,0,0,0,,Have you heard about the various \Nbooks and articles going around
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.34,0:03:22.06,main,Boss,0,0,0,,in the West that mock and slander Ostania?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.06,0:03:26.53,main,Boss,0,0,0,,It's all nothing but base lies \Nand conspiracy theories,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.53,0:03:29.88,top,Boss,0,0,0,,and a lot of them are printed \Nby Ostanian underground presses
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.88,0:03:31.62,top,Boss,0,0,0,,and being sold to the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.41,0:03:38.13,main,Boss,0,0,0,,And among the writers... \Nthis name popped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.39,0:03:42.63,main,Boss,0,0,0,,Franklin Perkin. Age 39.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.63,0:03:45.26,main,Boss,0,0,0,,He was a newspaper reporter during \Nthe previous administration,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:48.44,main,Boss,0,0,0,,and he was arrested for aiding \Nanti-government extremists.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.37,0:03:51.74,main,Boss,0,0,0,,I want you to follow him and \Nget the evidence we need,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.74,0:03:54.13,main,Boss,0,0,0,,as well as track down the \Nbuyers of the articles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.41,0:03:56.15,main,Boss,0,0,0,,As ridiculous as these articles are,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.15,0:03:59.38,main,Boss,0,0,0,,there are plenty of fools in \Nthe West who'll believe them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:02.91,main,Boss,0,0,0,,I want him dealt with before any \Nof this influences public opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.91,0:04:03.90,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.15,0:04:06.25,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Aren't we working Yuri a bit too hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.78,0:04:08.63,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I'll be just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.12,0:04:12.64,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Showing contempt for your own \Ncountry for chump change...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.59,0:04:17.70,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I can't even stand the thought of \Nthis filth breathing the same air
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.20,0:04:20.12,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,as my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.17,0:04:27.49,top,Yuri,0,0,0,,Observation of subject \NJ-095: Franklin Perkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.91,0:04:31.37,italicstop,Yuri,0,0,0,,On the 6th, subject wakes at 07:21.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.37,0:04:33.46,italicstop,Yuri,0,0,0,,Subject watches the television \Nprogram {\i0}Good Morning Ostania{\i1}.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:35.17,italicstop,Yuri,0,0,0,,Subject curses at the newscaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:41.18,italicstop,Yuri,0,0,0,,08:10, subject leaves \Nfor job at post office.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.62,0:04:44.78,italicstop,Yuri,0,0,0,,See appendices for details of his attire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:54.71,italicstop,Yuri,0,0,0,,Subject rides on third car of U-8 train.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.71,0:04:57.17,italicstop,Yuri,0,0,0,,See appendices for descriptions \Nof fellow passengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.18,0:05:01.93,italicstop,Yuri,0,0,0,,At 12:06, subject goes to the \Nrestaurant Fjord with coworker M.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.32,0:05:05.62,italicstop,Yuri,0,0,0,,Orders lunch Set A.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.62,0:05:07.25,italicstop,Yuri,0,0,0,,See appendices for log \Nof conversation topics.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.41,0:05:12.78,italicstop,Yuri,0,0,0,,At 17:49, subject leaves work \Nand goes to central market.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:21.21,italics,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,At noon today,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:25.68,italics,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,the 12th Annual International Education \NSymposium was held in Frejis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.68,0:05:28.93,italics,Vincent,0,0,0,,Sonia... were you deceiving me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.34,0:05:29.07,italicstop,Yuri,0,0,0,,At 18:33, subject returns home
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.93,0:05:34.26,italics,Sonia,0,0,0,,No, no! You're the only one I love, Vincent!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.07,0:05:33.06,italicstop,Yuri,0,0,0,,and watches television programs \N{\i0}News 20{\i1} and {\i0}Berlint in Love{\i1}.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:35.10,italicstop,Yuri,0,0,0,,Subject appears infatuated \Nwith the female lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.26,0:05:35.40,italics,Vincent,0,0,0,,Then why—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.40,0:05:36.68,italicstop,Sonia,0,0,0,,To prove my love—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:39.83,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,No further activities of note \Nbefore retiring for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.08,0:05:43.64,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,You sure didn't hold back on the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:45.25,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Leave this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.00,0:05:49.69,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,You've been at this for \Ntwo days without sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.33,0:05:52.70,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Switch out with someone \Nelse and get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.70,0:05:54.35,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Oh, this is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.91,0:05:56.88,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,This is the report for the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.70,0:06:01.37,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,"On the 7th, at 08:07, \Nsubject goes to work."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.37,0:06:03.92,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,"Has lunch at the restaurant \NFjord and orders lunch Set B..."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.39,0:06:08.59,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,"Fjord."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.00,0:06:11.03,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,"Yor."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.12,0:06:14.60,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,You're tired. Go rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.60,0:06:16.57,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,No. That always happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.83,0:06:25.16,main,Landlady,0,0,0,,Mister Perkin! Mister Perkin, \Nyou're home, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.87,0:06:34.97,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,H-Hey there, Ms. Landlady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:38.75,main,Landlady,0,0,0,,Could you pay me the rent \Nyou're late on already?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.77,0:06:42.41,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,Could you wait just a little longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.41,0:06:44.76,main,Landlady,0,0,0,,You said the same thing last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.02,0:06:48.50,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,The day after tomorrow! I promise \Nto pay you the day after tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:51.28,main,Landlady,0,0,0,,If you're lying again, I'll really \Nthrow you out this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.99,0:06:57.39,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,Stupid landlady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.92,0:07:02.19,italics,Perkin,0,0,0,,Dad, I'm heading out for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.19,0:07:04.81,italics,Perkin,0,0,0,,I made some food, so eat whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.81,0:07:06.82,italics,Perkin's Father,0,0,0,,All right. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.09,0:07:19.20,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Is he being cautious of anyone following him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.84,0:07:23.73,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Or he's looking for something \Nto write in his article.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.54,0:07:34.50,main,Politician,0,0,0,,Our country must face this with resolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:35.73,main,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yeah! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.73,0:07:38.10,main,Crowd,0,0,0,,Let's teach the West a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:08:00.12,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,I can't get any decent pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.78,0:08:13.46,main,Child A,0,0,0,,Yay! I got a Bondman replica \Npistol as a present!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:17.09,main,Child B,0,0,0,,No fair! Let me see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.50,0:08:19.43,main,Child A,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.43,0:08:20.90,main,Child C,0,0,0,,Meanie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.39,0:08:24.10,main,Child A,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:29.60,main,Child A,0,0,0,,My pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.13,0:08:37.84,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,Overcome by poverty,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:40.72,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,street children desperately \Ndig through trash for scraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:41.87,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.22,0:08:44.02,main,Child A,0,0,0,,What's the big idea, you stupid geezer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:46.31,main,Child B,0,0,0,,We're gonna tell the Secret Police on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.73,0:08:53.60,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,You little miser who keeps his wealth for \Nhimself and doesn't share it with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.63,0:08:57.73,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,People whose ideals lean toward \Nthe West, like yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.17,0:09:00.39,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,are the ones who are going to get arrested
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:01.72,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,and killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:02.87,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,That bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:04.18,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I'm gonna execute him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:04.18,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.03,0:09:09.95,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Let him go until we find out who's \Nbuying his underground publications.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.70,0:09:23.51,italics,Perkin,0,0,0,,This article should make some people laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.52,0:09:30.97,main,Perkin's Father,0,0,0,,Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.37,0:09:32.66,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:37.48,main,Perkin's Father,0,0,0,,You'd better not be doing \Nany dangerous work again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.48,0:09:40.47,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,I-I'm not. Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.22,0:09:43.84,main,Perkin's Father,0,0,0,,If you didn't have your odd sense of justice,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.84,0:09:47.47,main,Perkin's Father,0,0,0,,you'd have been able to keep \Nyour job at the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.81,0:09:59.43,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,What's so wrong about trying to improve \Nthe country my family lives in?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.41,0:10:07.48,italics,Perkin,0,0,0,,Even now... we need money just to \Nkeep up this lousy living situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.32,0:10:11.32,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,If we had money, Mom would've...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.44,0:10:16.78,main,Perkin's Father,0,0,0,,Frank, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:19.29,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,It's nothing. Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.41,0:10:52.88,italicstop,Yuri,0,0,0,,On the 11th at 08:36, \Nsubject leaves for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.27,0:11:04.69,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,He had no suspicious contacts or interactions
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.69,0:11:09.06,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,that may lead to the buyer while \Nat home or while he was out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.19,0:11:12.56,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.73,0:11:15.21,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,It must be his place of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.63,0:11:20.58,main,Postal worker,0,0,0,,Here's all the mail that's been inspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:21.91,main,Postal worker,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.91,0:11:23.73,main,Joseph,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.05,0:11:29.47,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,Hey, Joseph. I'll take care of these. \NGo ahead and take your lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.47,0:11:31.34,main,Joseph,0,0,0,,Oh, hey. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.56,0:11:33.38,main,Joseph,0,0,0,,What should I get for lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.51,0:12:00.88,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,So he was boldly mailing them after \Nslipping through inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.76,0:12:06.27,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,If you go through with mailing that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:09.60,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,You won't be able to talk \Nyour way out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.98,0:12:26.69,italicstop,Yuri,0,0,0,,On the 15th at 08:02.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.20,0:12:32.83,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,I'm heading to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:33.86,main,Perkin's Father,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:50.55,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,The State Security... Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.18,0:13:05.09,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,Sorry, Dad. I might not be back for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.94,0:13:14.69,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Franklin Perkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.31,0:13:18.99,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,You are the one who wrote this, are you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.89,0:13:25.96,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,We've already captured \Nthe buyer addressed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.96,0:13:27.34,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.14,0:13:31.01,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,You really bothered to wait outside for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.01,0:13:33.57,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,What kind State Security Service officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.97,0:13:37.58,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,It's so your family doesn't have \Nto see how pathetic you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.87,0:13:39.43,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.12,0:13:47.10,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,Me, who fought the government, \Nand you, the government's dog...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.85,0:13:50.22,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,I wonder who's really the pathetic one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.71,0:13:57.34,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I would never do anything \Nto make my family sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.98,0:13:59.26,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.24,0:14:12.23,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I'll request that your father gets \Nsome financial aid to get by.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.83,0:14:22.93,main,Perkin,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.18,0:14:31.73,main,Chief,0,0,0,,Hello there, Yuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.41,0:14:33.65,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.65,0:14:37.87,main,Chief,0,0,0,,You've been working hard! \NI'm happy to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.87,0:14:38.98,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I'm honored, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.59,0:14:42.65,main,Chief,0,0,0,,This must be rather difficult \Nwork for a newbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:45.28,main,Chief,0,0,0,,Don't let the stress build up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.89,0:14:46.91,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.91,0:14:50.40,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I think I'm quite well-suited for this job!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.71,0:14:55.94,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I'll use this momentum to capture Twilight \Nand protect the peace of this nation!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.99,0:15:00.85,main,Chief,0,0,0,,I see. I hope that's the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.03,0:15:04.99,main,Chief,0,0,0,,I'll treat you to a good meal sometime.\N Something with plenty of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.60,0:15:08.70,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Really?! I'm going to hold you to that, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.62,0:15:19.02,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.30,0:15:22.23,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Hiya, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.23,0:15:24.70,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yuri?! What brings you here so late?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:25.94,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Unkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.94,0:15:27.39,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Good evening, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.39,0:15:30.69,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,Grr! Why are you here, Loid Forger?! \NYou should stay at work, even at night!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.10,0:15:33.44,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:42.41,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I just felt like seeing you, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:47.84,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,What do you want, stupid leash girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.10,0:15:56.80,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Good job at work today. \NI'll get some tea ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.54,0:16:04.97,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,Sis, Sis...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:08.69,sign_9163_143_Sis_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\pos(150,20)\c&HBFACF4&\3c&H8B7BB4&\fad(357,1)}Yor
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.97,0:16:10.23,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,Sis, Sis, Sis, Sis, Sis, Sis, Sis, Sis, \NSis, Sis, Sis, Sis, Sis, Sis, Sis, Sis...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.51,0:16:14.26,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.85,0:16:14.81,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Blech...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.81,0:16:18.22,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Come, now. You're going to \Ndisturb the neighbors, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.67,0:16:26.92,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fscx82\fad(531,1)\pos(388,150)}The Elegant Bondman
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:32.67,italics,Bondman,0,0,0,,My name is Bondman!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.27,0:16:41.52,main,Bondman,0,0,0,,Leave this to me and run on ahead, Agent M!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:42.69,main,Agent M,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.69,0:16:45.48,main,Agent M,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.79,0:16:49.86,main,Bondman,0,0,0,,M...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.86,0:16:52.70,main,Agent M,0,0,0,,I'll follow you to the ends \Nof the earth, Bondman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.12,0:16:54.72,main,Bondman,0,0,0,,We're getting out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.61,0:16:57.69,italics,Bondman,0,0,0,,My spotless suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.69,0:17:00.20,italics,Bondman,0,0,0,,My beloved, gleaming silver car.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.20,0:17:03.70,italics,Bondman,0,0,0,,The techniques I mastered through countless \Nbattles, and my gentlemanly demeanor...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.70,0:17:06.72,main,Agent M,0,0,0,,Oh, you're such a masterful driver!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.87,0:17:09.75,main,Agent M,0,0,0,,I love you, Bondman!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.09,0:17:15.04,italics,Bondman,0,0,0,,Because I'm the coolest and so \Nclever, romance comes naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:18.78,main,Enemy spy,0,0,0,,I work as a spy in a country \Nyou consider an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.03,0:17:22.74,main,Enemy spy,0,0,0,,Get in my way and I'll \Nmake sure you regret it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.15,0:17:25.69,main,Bondman,0,0,0,,How foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.22,0:17:29.82,main,Bondman,0,0,0,,We're of the same species \Nand live on the same planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.12,0:17:32.78,main,Bondman,0,0,0,,Why do we need to fight over \Nsomething as petty as a boundary?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:36.39,main,Enemy spy,0,0,0,,In that case, why don't you \Ntry and stop this conflict?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.26,0:17:42.11,main,Bondman,0,0,0,,The peace treaty has been signed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.11,0:17:44.85,main,Bondman,0,0,0,,Now nothing can stand in our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:48.39,main,Enemy spy,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Bondman! \NI'll never let you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.97,0:17:53.41,main,Gina,0,0,0,,My father's obsessed with \Ncreating this Destroyer Bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.41,0:17:55.22,main,Gina,0,0,0,,Please stop him, Bondman!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.22,0:17:56.84,main,Bondman,0,0,0,,But of course, Gina!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:18:00.83,main,Gina,0,0,0,,Oh... Thank you so much, Bondman!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.83,0:18:03.65,main,Gina,0,0,0,,Once my father wakes up, \NI want to introduce you to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.65,0:18:05.85,main,Bondman,0,0,0,,Glad to hear it, Gina!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.85,0:18:10.15,main,Terrorist Woman,0,0,0,,My terrorist lover was arrested because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.15,0:18:11.80,main,Terrorist Woman,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.80,0:18:14.32,main,Bondman,0,0,0,,Revenge will only make you sadder.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:16.46,main,Bondman,0,0,0,,I'll make you forget about \Nall that with my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.97,0:18:21.86,main,Female Director,0,0,0,,Our organization's goal is \Nto take over the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.86,0:18:24.53,main,Bondman,0,0,0,,Never mind all that. Let's go out on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.38,0:18:32.14,main,Landlady 2,0,0,0,,Mister Bondman, please pay this month's rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.41,0:18:35.06,main,Landlady 2,0,0,0,,Also, there are noise complaints \Nfrom the neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.29,0:18:37.56,top,Bondman,0,0,0,,Hello there! You're as beautiful \Nas ever, Ms. Landlady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.36,0:18:47.80,main,Agent M,0,0,0,,Hey! What's with all these broads?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.80,0:18:49.46,main,Terrorist Woman,0,0,0,,Pick one already, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.46,0:18:50.02,main,Bondman,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.65,0:18:51.01,main,Enemy Spy,0,0,0,,How many of us are you dating?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.34,0:18:52.24,main,Woman,0,0,0,,You cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:56.64,main,Bondman,0,0,0,,I'm going to make every last \Nlady in this world happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.78,0:19:13.03,italics,Bondman,0,0,0,,Dealing with risk is just \Npart of a spy's job...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.03,0:19:16.82,italics,TV Narrator,0,0,0,,{\i0}Spy Wars{\i1}! Next time, "Bondman Returns!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.82,0:19:20.17,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I see. So this is what a flirting story is like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.49,0:19:23.05,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Now I can discuss this with Becky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:25.22,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya has become an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:26.41,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.41,0:19:29.43,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,How was anything he did gentlemanly?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.07,0:19:48.95,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The bright crimson that \Nappears right before my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.67,0:19:58.88,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stretches approximately 40,000 kilometers
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.01,0:20:06.72,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our wounds that inch closer behind us
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.72,0:20:11.81,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Make us wander even more \Nwhen we're already lost
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.81,0:20:16.40,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The unseeable, scentless, unmistakable future
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:18.32,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stabbed me in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.32,0:20:19.49,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.49,0:20:29.04,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Let me stay by your side tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:36.75,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Just for tonight, I'm going to be serious
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.05,0:20:40.59,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Come closer to me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.59,0:20:42.88,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Even the future we prayed for
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.88,0:20:44.93,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Has a different path
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.93,0:20:48.47,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,My dear
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.02,0:20:52.52,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our malice for each other
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:55.81,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Might just get to us
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.19,0:21:00.40,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Or maybe not
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.90,0:21:03.90,sign_30232_240_Extra_1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(325,110)}Extra I
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.90,0:21:03.90,sign_30232_240_Extra_1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnVerdana\fs13\pos(322,285)\3c&H4D5945&}The Heart of a Child I
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.90,0:21:07.41,sign_30304_242_On_the_Departmen,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(360,300)\blur2}On the Department Store Roof
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.94,0:21:10.52,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya wants to ride Mister Polar Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.44,0:21:15.12,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I cannot comprehend what is \Nso entertaining about this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.12,0:21:17.06,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,mysterious means of transportation \Ncalled "Polar Bear."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.06,0:21:19.55,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Why do children insist on riding this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:21.78,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,It's clearly boring and not exhilarating.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.78,0:21:23.79,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Plus, it almost seems \Nlike a corrective device
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.79,0:21:26.89,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,created by an authoritarian regime \Nto steal the emotions of the passenger
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.89,0:21:28.79,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,and change them into a \Nmindless puppet and—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.79,0:21:32.79,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I wanna ride it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.68,0:21:33.80,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Let's let her ride it, Loid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.50,0:21:47.81,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Was that fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.24,0:21:49.75,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I gotta ride it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.30,0:21:52.10,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I don't understand children.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.58,0:21:55.58,sign_30232_240_Extra_1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(325,110)}Extra II
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.58,0:21:55.58,sign_30232_240_Extra_1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnVerdana\fs13\pos(322,285)\3c&H4D5945&}The Heart of a Child II
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.16,0:22:00.09,italics,TV Announcer,0,0,0,,The Silt Seashore is packed with people \Nwanting to enjoy various seaside activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.40,0:22:02.68,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya wants to go to the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.10,0:22:06.60,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We can't go to the ocean, but I can \Nat least take you to the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.02,0:22:13.06,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Pool!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.74,0:22:18.16,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm so glad she seems to be having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.33,0:22:25.50,italicstop,Child 1,0,0,0,,Aw, man, I just peed. Not like \Nanyone's going to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.15,0:22:27.11,sign_32204_264___Don_t_try_this,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur2\pos(163,305)}* Don't try this at home, boys and girls
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.50,0:22:26.59,italicstop,Child 2,0,0,0,,I feel so much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.34,0:22:32.30,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I never want to go to the pool again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.30,0:22:35.31,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Huh?! But she looked like \Nshe was having so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.31,0:22:36.98,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I don't understand children.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.62,0:22:40.63,sign_30232_240_Extra_1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(325,120)}Extra III
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.62,0:22:40.63,sign_30232_240_Extra_1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnVerdana\fs13\pos(322,285)\3c&H4D5945&\fsp4}Waking Up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.14,0:22:53.27,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Lord Damian, you need to get up,\Nor you'll be late to roll call.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.27,0:22:54.34,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.73,0:22:58.22,main,Emil,0,0,0,,Lord Damian!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.22,0:22:59.76,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,You were already awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.16,0:23:03.01,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Yeah, about an hour ago. \NI was reviewing some things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.39,0:23:05.68,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Me oversleeping last week \Nwas just by chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.58,0:23:07.79,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Impressive as ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.77,0:23:13.41,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Wake up, Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.41,0:23:16.14,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You've only got ten minutes \Nuntil your bus gets here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.52,0:23:18.88,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya has ten more minutes \Nuntil the explosion...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.88,0:23:20.60,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya will stop it...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.60,0:23:22.33,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Come on, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.33,0:23:26.59,main,Loid,0,0,0,,If you keep going in late, \Nyou're going to get a Tonitrus Bolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.96,0:23:29.93,sign_13319_178__But_then_John_r,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,280)}She was late
